msgstr ""
"Bir eşte (peer) keşfedilen uzak bir GATT tanımlayıcısı. "
"`ClientCharacteristic` öğesinden :meth:`read <ClientCharacteristic.read>` ve"
" :meth:`write <ClientCharacteristic.write>` yöntemlerini devralır."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:742
msgid "The owning `ClientCharacteristic`."
msgstr "Sahip olan `ClientCharacteristic`\\ ."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:750
msgid ""
"An active L2CAP connection-oriented channel. Returned by "
":meth:`DeviceConnection.l2cap_accept` or "
":meth:`DeviceConnection.l2cap_connect`. Supports use as an ``async with`` "
"context manager that auto-disconnects on exit."
msgstr ""
"Etkin bir L2CAP bağlantı odaklı kanal. :meth:`DeviceConnection.l2cap_accept`"
" veya :meth:`DeviceConnection.l2cap_connect` tarafından döndürülür. Çıkışta "
